    "In this chat, Psyche will act without asking, except for sending to other people and payments, which still ask.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In this chat, Psyche will act without asking, except for sending to other people and payments, which still ask."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "في هذه المحادثة سيتصرف Psyche دون أن يسأل، باستثناء الإرسال إلى أشخاص آخرين والمدفوعات، فسيظل يسأل عنها."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In diesem Chat handelt Psyche ohne Rückfrage, außer beim Senden an andere Personen und bei Zahlungen. Dort fragt es weiterhin nach."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En este chat, Psyche actuará sin preguntar, salvo para enviar a otras personas y para pagos, que seguirán pidiendo permiso."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans cette conversation, Psyche agira sans demander, sauf pour les envois à d’autres personnes et les paiements, qui demandent toujours."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "इस चैट में Psyche बिना पूछे काम करेगा, सिवाय दूसरे लोगों को भेजने और भुगतान के, जिनके लिए वह अब भी पूछेगा।"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In questa chat Psyche agirà senza chiedere, tranne che per gli invii ad altre persone e per i pagamenti, che chiedono ancora."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このチャットでは、Psycheは確認なしで動作します。ただし、他の人への送信と支払いは引き続き確認します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 채팅에서 Psyche는 묻지 않고 작업합니다. 다른 사람에게 보내는 일과 결제는 계속 물어봅니다."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neste chat, o Psyche agirá sem perguntar, exceto para enviar a outras pessoas e para pagamentos, que continuam pedindo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在此聊天中，Psyche 将不再询问直接操作，但向他人发送内容和付款仍会询问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
